From c54f012e5324d2b378e98af1f3335e2b528efcdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:50:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): Recipes tab edits the surface speed and the
 chip load

Each Recipes row gets a surface speed (Vc) and a chip load (fz) input
under the table. A Vc edit sets the row's stored rpm, an fz edit sets
its stored feed; the project file does not change. The edits write the
editor's draft and land with the one Apply as one ChangeTool. A missing
flute count, a zero rpm or a zero diameter disables the input with a
reason; nothing divides by zero.

Fixes #4453

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
